# Absenta Multi-Teacher System - Complete Guide

## 👥 Multi-Teacher System Overview

**Absenta** mendukung sistem multi-guru untuk mata pelajaran yang sama dengan fitur:
- **Multiple teachers per subject** - Satu mata pelajaran bisa diajar oleh beberapa guru
- **Role-based assignment** - Primary, secondary, dan assistant teachers
- **Flexible scheduling** - Guru bisa mengajar di jadwal yang berbeda
- **Attendance tracking** - Absensi terpisah untuk setiap guru
- **Permission management** - Izin dan banding bisa diproses oleh guru yang relevan

## 🗄️ Database Schema for Multi-Teacher

### Enhanced Schedule Table (Based on absenta13.sql)
```sql
-- Tabel jadwal sudah ada dengan struktur:
CREATE TABLE `jadwal` (
  `id_jadwal` int(11) NOT NULL,
  `kelas_id` int(11) NOT NULL,
  `mapel_id` int(11) NOT NULL,
  `guru_id` int(11) NOT NULL,  -- Primary teacher
  `ruang_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,
  `hari` varchar(10) NOT NULL,
  `jam_ke` int(11) NOT NULL,
  `jam_mulai` time NOT NULL,
  `jam_selesai` time NOT NULL,
  `status` enum('aktif','tidak_aktif') NOT NULL DEFAULT 'aktif',
  `created_at` timestamp NULL DEFAULT current_timestamp()
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_general_ci;

-- Tabel baru untuk assignment guru tambahan
CREATE TABLE `jadwal_guru_tambahan` (
  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
  `jadwal_id` int(11) NOT NULL,
  `guru_id` int(11) NOT NULL,
  `role` enum('secondary','assistant','substitute') NOT NULL DEFAULT 'secondary',
  `status` enum('aktif','tidak_aktif') NOT NULL DEFAULT 'aktif',
  `created_at` timestamp NULL DEFAULT current_timestamp(),
  `updated_at` timestamp NULL DEFAULT current_timestamp() ON UPDATE current_timestamp(),
  
  -- Foreign keys
  FOREIGN KEY (`jadwal_id`) REFERENCES `jadwal`(`id_jadwal`) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  FOREIGN KEY (`guru_id`) REFERENCES `guru`(`id_guru`) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  
  -- Unique constraint
  UNIQUE KEY `unique_jadwal_guru` (`jadwal_id`, `guru_id`)
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_general_ci;

-- Tabel untuk tracking guru yang hadir per jadwal
CREATE TABLE `kehadiran_guru_jadwal` (
  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
  `jadwal_id` int(11) NOT NULL,
  `guru_id` int(11) NOT NULL,
  `tanggal` date NOT NULL,
  `status` enum('Hadir','Tidak Hadir','Sakit','Izin','Dispen','Terlambat') NOT NULL,
  `keterangan` text DEFAULT NULL,
  `waktu_catat` timestamp NOT NULL DEFAULT current_timestamp(),
  `metode_absen` enum('manual','scan','otomatis') DEFAULT 'manual',
  `dikonfirmasi_oleh` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,
  
  -- Foreign keys
  FOREIGN KEY (`jadwal_id`) REFERENCES `jadwal`(`id_jadwal`),
  FOREIGN KEY (`guru_id`) REFERENCES `guru`(`id_guru`),
  FOREIGN KEY (`dikonfirmasi_oleh`) REFERENCES `users`(`id`),
  
  -- Unique constraint
  UNIQUE KEY `unique_guru_jadwal_tanggal` (`jadwal_id`, `guru_id`, `tanggal`)
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_general_ci;
```

## 🔄 Multi-Teacher Business Logic

### Multi-Teacher Assignment Logic
```javascript
const multiTeacherAssignmentLogic = {
  // 1. Assign additional teachers to schedule
  assignAdditionalTeachers: async (jadwalId, teachers) => {
    try {
      await db.withTransaction(async (connection) => {
        // Remove existing additional teachers
        await connection.execute(
          'DELETE FROM jadwal_guru_tambahan WHERE jadwal_id = ?',
          [jadwalId]
        );
        
        // Add new additional teachers
        for (const teacher of teachers) {
          await connection.execute(
            `INSERT INTO jadwal_guru_tambahan (jadwal_id, guru_id, role, status) 
             VALUES (?, ?, ?, 'aktif')`,
            [jadwalId, teacher.guru_id, teacher.role || 'secondary']
          );
        }
      });
      
      console.log(`✅ Assigned ${teachers.length} additional teachers to schedule ${jadwalId}`);
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('❌ Error assigning additional teachers:', error);
      throw error;
    }
  },
  
  // 2. Get all teachers for a schedule
  getScheduleTeachers: async (jadwalId) => {
    const [teachers] = await db.execute(`
      SELECT 
        'primary' as role,
        g.id_guru,
        g.nama as nama_guru,
        g.nip,
        g.email,
        u.username,
        j.guru_id as assigned_guru_id
      FROM jadwal j
      JOIN guru g ON j.guru_id = g.id_guru
      JOIN users u ON g.user_id = u.id
      WHERE j.id_jadwal = ?
      
      UNION ALL
      
      SELECT 
        jgt.role,
        g.id_guru,
        g.nama as nama_guru,
        g.nip,
        g.email,
        u.username,
        jgt.guru_id as assigned_guru_id
      FROM jadwal_guru_tambahan jgt
      JOIN guru g ON jgt.guru_id = g.id_guru
      JOIN users u ON g.user_id = u.id
      WHERE jgt.jadwal_id = ? AND jgt.status = 'aktif'
      
      ORDER BY 
        CASE role 
          WHEN 'primary' THEN 1 
          WHEN 'secondary' THEN 2 
          WHEN 'assistant' THEN 3 
          WHEN 'substitute' THEN 4 
        END,
        nama_guru
    `, [jadwalId, jadwalId]);
    
    return teachers;
  },
  
  // 3. Check if teacher is assigned to schedule
  isTeacherAssigned: async (jadwalId, guruId) => {
    const [result] = await db.execute(`
      SELECT 'primary' as role FROM jadwal WHERE id_jadwal = ? AND guru_id = ?
      UNION ALL
      SELECT role FROM jadwal_guru_tambahan 
      WHERE jadwal_id = ? AND guru_id = ? AND status = 'aktif'
    `, [jadwalId, guruId, jadwalId, guruId]);
    
    return result.length > 0 ? result[0] : null;
  },
  
  // 4. Get schedules for a teacher
  getTeacherSchedules: async (guruId, status = 'aktif') => {
    const [schedules] = await db.execute(`
      SELECT 
        j.*,
        'primary' as role,
        m.nama_mapel,
        k.nama_kelas,
        r.nama_ruang
      FROM jadwal j
      JOIN mapel m ON j.mapel_id = m.id_mapel
      JOIN kelas k ON j.kelas_id = k.id_kelas
      LEFT JOIN ruang_kelas r ON j.ruang_id = r.id_ruang
      WHERE j.guru_id = ? AND j.status = ?
      
      UNION ALL
      
      SELECT 
        j.*,
        jgt.role,
        m.nama_mapel,
        k.nama_kelas,
        r.nama_ruang
      FROM jadwal_guru_tambahan jgt
      JOIN jadwal j ON jgt.jadwal_id = j.id_jadwal
      JOIN mapel m ON j.mapel_id = m.id_mapel
      JOIN kelas k ON j.kelas_id = k.id_kelas
      LEFT JOIN ruang_kelas r ON j.ruang_id = r.id_ruang
      WHERE jgt.guru_id = ? AND jgt.status = 'aktif' AND j.status = ?
      
      ORDER BY hari, jam_ke
    `, [guruId, status, guruId, status]);
    
    return schedules;
  }
};
```

### Multi-Teacher Attendance Logic
```javascript
const multiTeacherAttendanceLogic = {
  // 1. Record teacher attendance for specific schedule
  recordTeacherAttendance: async (attendanceData) => {
    const {
      jadwalId,
      guruId,
      tanggal,
      status,
      keterangan,
      metodeAbsen = 'manual',
      dikonfirmasiOleh
    } = attendanceData;
    
    try {
      // Check if teacher is assigned to schedule
      const assignment = await multiTeacherAssignmentLogic.isTeacherAssigned(jadwalId, guruId);
      if (!assignment) {
        throw new Error('Guru tidak ditugaskan pada jadwal ini');
      }
      
      // Check if attendance already exists
      const [existing] = await db.execute(
        'SELECT id FROM kehadiran_guru_jadwal WHERE jadwal_id = ? AND guru_id = ? AND tanggal = ?',
        [jadwalId, guruId, tanggal]
      );
      
      if (existing.length > 0) {
        // Update existing attendance
        await db.execute(
          `UPDATE kehadiran_guru_jadwal 
           SET status = ?, keterangan = ?, metode_absen = ?, waktu_catat = NOW(), dikonfirmasi_oleh = ?
           WHERE id = ?`,
          [status, keterangan, metodeAbsen, dikonfirmasiOleh, existing[0].id]
        );
      } else {
        // Create new attendance record
        await db.execute(
          `INSERT INTO kehadiran_guru_jadwal 
           (jadwal_id, guru_id, tanggal, status, keterangan, metode_absen, dikonfirmasi_oleh)
           VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)`,
          [jadwalId, guruId, tanggal, status, keterangan, metodeAbsen, dikonfirmasiOleh]
        );
      }
      
      console.log(`✅ Teacher attendance recorded: ${guruId} - ${status}`);
      
      // Send notification to other teachers in the same schedule
      await notificationService.sendTeacherAttendanceNotification(jadwalId, guruId, {
        status,
        keterangan,
        role: assignment.role
      });
      
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('❌ Error recording teacher attendance:', error);
      throw error;
    }
  },
  
  // 2. Get teacher attendance for a schedule
  getScheduleTeacherAttendance: async (jadwalId, tanggal = null) => {
    const targetDate = tanggal || new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];
    
    const [attendance] = await db.execute(`
      SELECT 
        kgj.*,
        g.nama as nama_guru,
        g.nip,
        u.username,
        jgt.role,
        j.hari,
        j.jam_ke,
        j.jam_mulai,
        j.jam_selesai
      FROM kehadiran_guru_jadwal kgj
      JOIN guru g ON kgj.guru_id = g.id_guru
      JOIN users u ON g.user_id = u.id
      LEFT JOIN jadwal_guru_tambahan jgt ON kgj.jadwal_id = jgt.jadwal_id AND kgj.guru_id = jgt.guru_id
      JOIN jadwal j ON kgj.jadwal_id = j.id_jadwal
      WHERE kgj.jadwal_id = ? AND kgj.tanggal = ?
      ORDER BY 
        CASE jgt.role 
          WHEN 'primary' THEN 1 
          WHEN 'secondary' THEN 2 
          WHEN 'assistant' THEN 3 
          WHEN 'substitute' THEN 4 
        END,
        g.nama
    `, [jadwalId, targetDate]);
    
    return attendance;
  },
  
  // 3. Get teacher attendance summary
  getTeacherAttendanceSummary: async (guruId, startDate, endDate) => {
    const [summary] = await db.execute(`
      SELECT 
        COUNT(*) as total_sessions,
        SUM(CASE WHEN kgj.status = 'Hadir' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as hadir,
        SUM(CASE WHEN kgj.status = 'Tidak Hadir' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as tidak_hadir,
        SUM(CASE WHEN kgj.status = 'Sakit' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as sakit,
        SUM(CASE WHEN kgj.status = 'Izin' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as izin,
        SUM(CASE WHEN kgj.status = 'Terlambat' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as terlambat,
        (SUM(CASE WHEN kgj.status = 'Hadir' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*)) * 100 as attendance_rate
      FROM kehadiran_guru_jadwal kgj
      WHERE kgj.guru_id = ? AND kgj.tanggal BETWEEN ? AND ?
    `, [guruId, startDate, endDate]);
    
    return summary[0];
  }
};
```

### Multi-Teacher Permission Logic
```javascript
const multiTeacherPermissionLogic = {
  // 1. Get available teachers for permission processing
  getAvailableTeachersForPermission: async (jadwalId) => {
    const [teachers] = await db.execute(`
      SELECT 
        g.id_guru,
        g.nama as nama_guru,
        g.nip,
        g.email,
        u.username,
        'primary' as role
      FROM jadwal j
      JOIN guru g ON j.guru_id = g.id_guru
      JOIN users u ON g.user_id = u.id
      WHERE j.id_jadwal = ? AND g.status = 'aktif'
      
      UNION ALL
      
      SELECT 
        g.id_guru,
        g.nama as nama_guru,
        g.nip,
        g.email,
        u.username,
        jgt.role
      FROM jadwal_guru_tambahan jgt
      JOIN guru g ON jgt.guru_id = g.id_guru
      JOIN users u ON g.user_id = u.id
      WHERE jgt.jadwal_id = ? AND jgt.status = 'aktif' AND g.status = 'aktif'
      
      ORDER BY 
        CASE role 
          WHEN 'primary' THEN 1 
          WHEN 'secondary' THEN 2 
          WHEN 'assistant' THEN 3 
          WHEN 'substitute' THEN 4 
        END
    `, [jadwalId, jadwalId]);
    
    return teachers;
  },
  
  // 2. Assign permission to specific teacher
  assignPermissionToTeacher: async (izinId, guruId) => {
    try {
      await db.execute(
        'UPDATE pengajuan_izin_siswa SET diproses_oleh = ? WHERE id_izin = ?',
        [guruId, izinId]
      );
      
      console.log(`✅ Permission ${izinId} assigned to teacher ${guruId}`);
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('❌ Error assigning permission to teacher:', error);
      throw error;
    }
  },
  
  // 3. Get permissions assigned to teacher
  getTeacherAssignedPermissions: async (guruId, status = null) => {
    let query = `
      SELECT 
        piz.*,
        s.nama as nama_siswa,
        s.nis,
        j.hari,
        j.jam_ke,
        j.jam_mulai,
        j.jam_selesai,
        m.nama_mapel,
        k.nama_kelas
      FROM pengajuan_izin_siswa piz
      JOIN siswa_perwakilan s ON piz.siswa_id = s.id_siswa
      JOIN jadwal j ON piz.jadwal_id = j.id_jadwal
      JOIN mapel m ON j.mapel_id = m.id_mapel
      JOIN kelas k ON piz.kelas_id = k.id_kelas
      WHERE piz.diproses_oleh = ?
    `;
    
    const params = [guruId];
    
    if (status) {
      query += ' AND piz.status_izin = ?';
      params.push(status);
    }
    
    query += ' ORDER BY piz.tanggal_pengajuan DESC';
    
    const [permissions] = await db.execute(query, params);
    return permissions;
  }
};
```

## 📱 Frontend Components

### Multi-Teacher Assignment Component
```typescript
// MultiTeacherAssignmentComponent.tsx
interface MultiTeacherAssignmentProps {
  scheduleId: number;
  onTeachersAssigned: (teachers: any[]) => void;
}

const MultiTeacherAssignmentComponent: React.FC<MultiTeacherAssignmentProps> = ({
  scheduleId,
  onTeachersAssigned
}) => {
  const [availableTeachers, setAvailableTeachers] = useState([]);
  const [assignedTeachers, setAssignedTeachers] = useState([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);

  const loadAvailableTeachers = async () => {
    try {
      const response = await api.get('/api/teachers/available');
      setAvailableTeachers(response.data);
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Error loading teachers:', error);
    }
  };

  const loadAssignedTeachers = async () => {
    try {
      const response = await api.get(`/api/schedules/${scheduleId}/teachers`);
      setAssignedTeachers(response.data);
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Error loading assigned teachers:', error);
    }
  };

  const assignTeacher = async (teacherId: number, role: string) => {
    try {
      setLoading(true);
      await api.post(`/api/schedules/${scheduleId}/teachers`, {
        guru_id: teacherId,
        role
      });
      
      loadAssignedTeachers();
      onTeachersAssigned(assignedTeachers);
      
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Error assigning teacher:', error);
      toast.error('Gagal menugaskan guru');
    } finally {
      setLoading(false);
    }
  };

  const removeTeacher = async (teacherId: number) => {
    try {
      setLoading(true);
      await api.delete(`/api/schedules/${scheduleId}/teachers/${teacherId}`);
      
      loadAssignedTeachers();
      onTeachersAssigned(assignedTeachers);
      
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Error removing teacher:', error);
      toast.error('Gagal menghapus guru');
    } finally {
      setLoading(false);
    }
  };

  useEffect(() => {
    loadAvailableTeachers();
    loadAssignedTeachers();
  }, [scheduleId]);

  return (
    <div className="multi-teacher-assignment">
      <h3>Penugasan Multi-Guru</h3>
      
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        {/* Assigned Teachers */}
        <div>
          <h4>Guru yang Ditugaskan</h4>
          <div className="space-y-2">
            {assignedTeachers.map(teacher => (
              <div key={teacher.id_guru} className="flex items-center justify-between p-3 border rounded">
                <div>
                  <p className="font-medium">{teacher.nama_guru}</p>
                  <p className="text-sm text-gray-500">{teacher.role}</p>
                </div>
                <Button
                  variant="outline"
                  size="sm"
                  onClick={() => removeTeacher(teacher.id_guru)}
                  disabled={loading}
                >
                  Hapus
                </Button>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        
        {/* Available Teachers */}
        <div>
          <h4>Guru Tersedia</h4>
          <div className="space-y-2">
            {availableTeachers.map(teacher => (
              <div key={teacher.id_guru} className="flex items-center justify-between p-3 border rounded">
                <div>
                  <p className="font-medium">{teacher.nama_guru}</p>
                  <p className="text-sm text-gray-500">{teacher.mata_pelajaran}</p>
                </div>
                <div className="flex gap-2">
                  <Select onValueChange={(role) => assignTeacher(teacher.id_guru, role)}>
                    <SelectTrigger className="w-32">
                      <SelectValue placeholder="Pilih Role" />
                    </SelectTrigger>
                    <SelectContent>
                      <SelectItem value="secondary">Secondary</SelectItem>
                      <SelectItem value="assistant">Assistant</SelectItem>
                      <SelectItem value="substitute">Substitute</SelectItem>
                    </SelectContent>
                  </Select>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
};
```

### Multi-Teacher Attendance Component
```typescript
// MultiTeacherAttendanceComponent.tsx
interface MultiTeacherAttendanceProps {
  scheduleId: number;
  date: string;
  onAttendanceRecorded: (attendance: any) => void;
}

const MultiTeacherAttendanceComponent: React.FC<MultiTeacherAttendanceProps> = ({
  scheduleId,
  date,
  onAttendanceRecorded
}) => {
  const [teachers, setTeachers] = useState([]);
  const [attendance, setAttendance] = useState({});
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);

  const loadTeachers = async () => {
    try {
      const response = await api.get(`/api/schedules/${scheduleId}/teachers`);
      setTeachers(response.data);
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Error loading teachers:', error);
    }
  };

  const loadAttendance = async () => {
    try {
      const response = await api.get(`/api/schedules/${scheduleId}/attendance?tanggal=${date}`);
      const attendanceData = {};
      response.data.forEach(att => {
        attendanceData[att.guru_id] = att;
      });
      setAttendance(attendanceData);
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Error loading attendance:', error);
    }
  };

  const recordAttendance = async (guruId: number, status: string, keterangan?: string) => {
    try {
      setLoading(true);
      await api.post('/api/attendance/teacher', {
        jadwalId: scheduleId,
        guruId,
        tanggal: date,
        status,
        keterangan
      });
      
      setAttendance(prev => ({
        ...prev,
        [guruId]: { status, keterangan }
      }));
      
      onAttendanceRecorded({ guruId, status, keterangan });
      
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Error recording attendance:', error);
      toast.error('Gagal mencatat absensi');
    } finally {
      setLoading(false);
    }
  };

  useEffect(() => {
    loadTeachers();
    loadAttendance();
  }, [scheduleId, date]);

  return (
    <div className="multi-teacher-attendance">
      <h3>Absensi Multi-Guru</h3>
      <p className="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">Tanggal: {date}</p>
      
      <div className="space-y-4">
        {teachers.map(teacher => (
          <div key={teacher.id_guru} className="border rounded-lg p-4">
            <div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
              <div>
                <h4 className="font-medium">{teacher.nama_guru}</h4>
                <p className="text-sm text-gray-500">{teacher.role} • {teacher.nip}</p>
              </div>
              <div className="text-sm">
                {attendance[teacher.id_guru] ? (
                  <span className={`px-2 py-1 rounded ${
                    attendance[teacher.id_guru].status === 'Hadir' ? 'bg-green-100 text-green-800' :
                    attendance[teacher.id_guru].status === 'Tidak Hadir' ? 'bg-red-100 text-red-800' :
                    'bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800'
                  }`}>
                    {attendance[teacher.id_guru].status}
                  </span>
                ) : (
                  <span className="text-gray-500">Belum absen</span>
                )}
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div className="flex gap-2">
              {['Hadir', 'Tidak Hadir', 'Sakit', 'Izin', 'Terlambat'].map(status => (
                <Button
                  key={status}
                  variant={attendance[teacher.id_guru]?.status === status ? 'default' : 'outline'}
                  size="sm"
                  onClick={() => recordAttendance(teacher.id_guru, status)}
                  disabled={loading}
                >
                  {status}
                </Button>
              ))}
            </div>
            
            {attendance[teacher.id_guru]?.keterangan && (
              <p className="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
                Keterangan: {attendance[teacher.id_guru].keterangan}
              </p>
            )}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  );
};
